{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108240","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1910824001:1":{"text":"我带来了礼物，一枚特殊的宝石。","source_cn":"我带来了礼物，一枚特殊的宝石。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xE008A2B19A531277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910824002:1":{"text":"它是陆地的造物，不在海中生长，不被潮汐打磨。陆地上的人说，每一枚宝石里都藏着一截不同的天色。","source_cn":"它是陆地的造物，不在海中生长，不被潮汐打磨。陆地上的人...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x202550B2C0047922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910824003:1":{"text":"而我带来的这一枚，它诞生于某个有风穿过的地方。在那里，一天之中的阳光和月光会从不同角度洒下，凝聚为不同的色泽。","source_cn":"而我带来的这一枚，它诞生于某个有风穿过的地方。在那里，...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x18272DB64D77D3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910824004:1":{"text":"这是一枚会随光线改变颜色的宝石，奥汐娜，它很适合你。","source_cn":"这是一枚会随光线改变颜色的宝石，奥汐娜，它很适合你。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A04ADF35A86258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910824005:1":{"text":"陆地上的凡人正在对流光海彻夜祈祷，他们高声称颂，认定海啸在最后时刻改变了流向，此乃神迹。","source_cn":"陆地上的凡人正在对流光海彻夜祈祷，他们高声称颂，认定海...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xADAC58CB2CA32CE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910824006:1":{"text":"哦，可爱的陆地人，他们认错了人。明明是我的复苏造成了海啸，是你保护了他们。","source_cn":"哦，可爱的陆地人，他们认错了人。明明是我的复苏造成了海...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x81F2FB9E194A7893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910824007:1":{"text":"那来自于你的愿望。奥汐娜，你抹杀了海裔，与此同时，却让我去拯救陆地的凡人。","source_cn":"那来自于你的愿望。奥汐娜，你抹杀了海裔，与此同时，却让...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAA51ECFCB09E2355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910824008:1":{"text":"我一直在想你说过的话——“就连神明也可以发生变化”。","source_cn":"我一直在想你说过的话——“就连神明也可以发生变化”。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF8EFE6085F6A2C4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910824009:1":{"text":"此次到访前，我曾前往西方，在彼处目睹到壮烈的日落。","source_cn":"此次到访前，我曾前往西方，在彼处目睹到壮烈的日落。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xD654B2D8F2DFECB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910824010:1":{"text":"瑞·索卡尔死了，他为凡人而死。无人向他祈求，他却自愿献出鲜血，染红大漠。","source_cn":"瑞·索卡尔死了，他为凡人而死。无人向他祈求，他却自愿献...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x78337A662B06B15B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","v